  "_comment": "The Fabric API module each of Fabricated's own mixins serves (NativeModules), on every NeoForge version: when another mod provides that module (Forgified Fabric API, Sodium's bundled modules), the mixin stands down with Fabricated's copy of it. A list names the module under each name it has had; an empty list is a mixin serving no module (loading Fabric mods: registries, entrypoints, fluids, vanilla behaviour Fabric mods rely on), which always applies. A mixin config in a Fabric API package belongs to the module owning the package; configs in Fabricated's packages are listed under configs. The build refuses a mixin of fabricated.mixins.json missing here.",
